WEBVTT

00:05:27.522 --> 00:05:30.514
because I thought when they were saying,
"Thank you very much,"

00:05:30.538 --> 00:05:31.800
that meant for me to stay.

00:05:31.824 --> 00:05:34.704
(Laughter)

00:05:34.728 --> 00:05:36.315
I ran up the steps,

00:05:36.339 --> 00:05:38.656
and there was a man sitting on the steps.

00:05:39.688 --> 00:05:41.355
And I barely noticed him.

00:05:41.768 --> 00:05:43.037
He was an observer.

00:05:43.061 --> 00:05:45.022
Three days later, that man called me

00:05:45.046 --> 00:05:48.688
and asked me, would I like to join
the Alvin Ailey American Dance Theater.

00:05:48.712 --> 00:05:51.450
That's how it happened, folks, that's it.

00:05:51.474 --> 00:05:53.430
There's no drama or trauma.

00:05:53.454 --> 00:05:55.720
(Applause)

00:05:55.744 --> 00:05:58.458
So I spent 15 years dancing
with the company,

00:05:58.482 --> 00:06:01.400
and then I directed it
for something like 21 years.